      "title": "Add GEN (GenLayer) on Ethereum and Base",
      "author": "MuncleUscles",
      "number": 1401,
      "body": "Adds GenLayer (GEN) on Ethereum and Base.\n\n- Ethereum: `0x4242424228C275C5b44E24C53f081E9246025a2f` (ERC-20, 18 decimals)\n- Base: `0xDcDd3A0425770Fea7f4D90FD8810e08FDe6b2CA9`, an OptimismMintableERC20 (1.4.1) created by the factory `0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000012` in tx `0xda63f1c5ba6de06af1e4eddd7c4c68e8c65c07a9d1d9e03f644b4e76c51f4e85`. Remote token is the Ethereum address above; bridge is `0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000010`. No overrides.\n- Logo: official GEN token icon (https://www.genlayer.com/brand).\n\n`npx tsx ./bin/cli.ts validate --datadir ./data --tokens GEN` passes locally with no errors or warnings.\n",
